# "If you cast it": Bringer put onto the battlefield from the graveyard with Reanimate (Entomb put it there) was not
# cast, so the trigger never happens (CR 603.4; ruling). Bot2's Ornithopter and Bot1's own Mox stay, and Bot1 pays 8 life
# for the Reanimate (Bringer's mana value). The positive control, cast, is in
# bringer-of-the-last-gift-sacrifices-all-other-creatures-and-returns-the-cards-that-were-already-in-graveyards.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Entomb
Reanimate
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Bringer of the Last Gift
Swamp x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Ornithopter
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Entomb.Cast
Bot1.Search(Bringer of the Last Gift)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Reanimate.Cast(Bot1.Graveyard.Bringer of the Last Gift)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 12
Bot1.Battlefield = Swamp; Swamp; Mox Jet; Bringer of the Last Gift
Bot2.Battlefield = Ornithopter
Bot1.Graveyard = Reanimate; Entomb
Stack.Count = 0
